OL,3,GNEWSAFreed inmates warn not all ready
OL,4,Afor early release
OL,5,
OL,6,FNewly freed prisoners released as part
OL,7,Fof the government's scheme to ease
OL,8,Fovercrowding have voiced their concerns
OL,9,Fsome of those let out early could end
OL,10,Fup back behind bars.
OL,12,FAround 700 people are leaving prisons
OL,13,Facross England and Wales under the
OL,14,Fearly prisoner release plan - with a
OL,15,Ffurther 3,800 scheduled for release
OL,16,Fover the next year.
OL,18,FThose freed on Thursday had been
OL,19,Fserving sentences of up to 19 months,
OL,20,Fbut were released after completing 33%
OL,21,Frather than 50% of their term.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
